# Never bake these into the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
.vscode

# Secrets: the platform injects env vars at runtime. The .env file must never
# enter the image.
.env
.env.*

# Note: apps/web source is intentionally NOT excluded. pnpm --frozen-lockfile
# validates the lockfile against every workspace package.json, so all of them
# must be present in the build context; the web app's deps still aren't installed
# because the install is filtered to `@kloyya/api...`.

# Docs and local noise.
*.md
